      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITZA SOPHIE (1) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some superb recent form, including a six-run winning streak, but could only manage fifth (30.02) at this track. The form from her last run stacks up well. Rates on top in this line up. MAGPIE HECTOR (4) is generally an honest type in the frame at 15 of 45 starts but missed the placings last time when fourth (26.12) over 457m at Temora. Solid record at this trip including five wins. Looks suited and expected to run well. WEST ROCK CASEY (2) was well back throughout but attacked the line strongly to place, 1.75 lengths from the winner (29.82) at Richmond in NG. Must be included in calculations.",
